{"action": "shared_understanding_confirmed", "at": "2026-09-18T00:43:43+00:00", "data": {"summary": "Compact widget adopts the round-2 right-aligned ledger composition with shrunk type; counts become live via one GET /repos/{owner}/{name} per refresh with issues derived as open_issues_count minus openPrs; basis degrades honestly rather than rendering a bound as exact. Bounded to the compact slot: the tall row feed keeps its FIXTURE PREVIEW label until a later cycle. Verification is JVM unit tests (adding glance-appwidget-testing) plus a rendered Fold capture; live-data-on-device proof is a Bobby-gated step."}, "event_id": "674ca847-d042-4eb8-aada-08e9370586ce"}
